## Runtime Context

- **Package Manager:** pnpm (content-addressable storage)
- **Containers:** Docker Desktop, Docker Engine, Podman, or OrbStack
- **Local Inference:** Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, Open WebUI, or an agent-supported local provider

## Agent And Model Routing

> **Prefer local models for routine tasks** — file edits, simple refactors, lookups, and code formatting.
>
> **Use the strongest available model** for:
> - Complex architectural decisions
> - Multi-file refactors spanning 3+ modules
> - Domain modeling and PRD synthesis
> - When local model is unavailable or hits its context window
>
> When in doubt, start with the local model. Escalate to cloud only when needed.

