## Stack Standards

### Frontend
- **Web:** Next.js 16 (App Router)
- **Mobile:** Expo SDK 55
- **Styling:** NativeWind v4 (Tailwind engine)
- **Universal Logic:** Solito 5 (when applicable)

### Backend & Data
- **Cloud DB:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) — see `lib/supabase.ts`
- **Offline-First Mobile:** WatermelonDB — see `model/`
- **Auth:** Better-Auth (Passkey/FaceID-ready) — see `lib/auth.ts`

### Quality Gates
- **Pre-commit:** Husky + lint-staged + Shannon-Pro security audit
- **Unit Tests:** Vitest (run: `pnpm test`)
- **E2E Tests:** Playwright (run: `pnpm test:e2e`)
- **Types:** strict TypeScript (run: `pnpm typecheck`)
- **Agent PR Review:** CodeRabbit audits Sandcastle-generated PRs before merge

